@startuml sequence-scn-004-ai-task-tracker
' T-007 R-02 — SCN-004: AI search
' Trace: SCN-004 ↔ UC-E2E-004 | API: API-003
' Source: contracts §4.4, §6 (Ollama), §5 AI_SEARCH_UNAVAILABLE
autonumber
title SCN-004 — AI search (UC-E2E-004)

actor "User" as user
participant "Vue SPA (S-03)" as spa
participant "api (SearchService)" as api
participant "store (pgvector)" as pg
participant "llm (Ollama localhost:11434)" as llm

user -> spa : type «настройка CI для репозитория»
spa -> spa : validate (blank → «Введите запрос», request not sent)
spa -> api : POST /api/search {query, limit:5} (API-003)
api -> llm : POST /api/embed (query → 1024-dim)
llm --> api : embeddings
api -> pg : vector(1024) recall top-K
pg --> api : candidate tasks
api -> llm : POST /api/chat (re-rank + RU snippets, 15 s bound)
llm --> api : ranked task_id list + snippets
api --> spa : 200 {results:[{task_id:TASK-001, score:0.91, snippet:«…GitLab CI…»}]}
note over spa : S-03 top-K results; TASK-001 in top; answer < 15 s (R-023)
user -> spa : unrelated query «рецепт борща»
spa -> api : POST /api/search
api --> spa : 200 {results:[]}
note over spa : S-03 «Ничего не найдено. Попробуйте изменить запрос.» (no fabricated matches)
== Ollama down / timeout (E case) ==
user -> spa : query while Ollama stopped
spa -> api : POST /api/search
api -> llm : POST /api/embed (timeout > 15 s)
llm --> api : connection error
api --> spa : 503 {code:AI_SEARCH_UNAVAILABLE, message:«AI-поиск недоступен: LLM не отвечает. Попробуйте позже.»}
note over spa : S-03 error state + «Повторить»;\nlist/calendar/tokens keep working (R-028)
@enduml
